		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Outer dragon tainted by long exposure to alien energy. Appears as non-tainted dragon. Malign, scheming.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8 + obliterate) or 1 void breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Obliterate</strong>. If target reduced to 0 HP, CON 18+ or decays instantly, turns to dust.</p><p></p><p><strong>Starflight</strong>. Dragon and riders can survive the interstellar void. Able to fly between worlds in 1d4 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Void Breath</strong>. A double near- size cube of airless void extending from the dragon. Creatures within suffocate for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Voidblood</strong>. Cold immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
